---
// What we make. Each service is a native <details> row, so opening one is
// keyboard- and screen-reader-friendly with no script.
---

<section id="services" class="f-section f-services" aria-labelledby="f-services-title">
  <div class="f-wrap f-services__grid">
    <div class="f-services__head" data-f-reveal>
      <h2 class="f-h2" id="f-services-title">What we make</h2>
      <p class="f-lede">
        Six things, done properly. Most clients start with a website and add the rest as the
        business grows. Open any of them to see what's included.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="f-service-list">
      <li data-f-reveal style="--d:0.00s">
        <details class="f-service" open>
          <summary>
            <span class="f-service__name">Websites</span>
            <span class="f-service__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="f-service__body">
            <p>
              Fast, custom-built sites that explain what you do in seconds and make the next step
              obvious. Built so you can change them without calling us.
            </p>
            <ul class="f-leaflist">
              <li>Landing pages to full multi-page sites</li>
              <li>Built to load fast on phones</li>
              <li>Easy content editing after launch</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>
      </li>
      <li data-f-reveal style="--d:0.07s">
        <details class="f-service">
          <summary>
            <span class="f-service__name">Interface design</span>
            <span class="f-service__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="f-service__body">
            <p>
              Screens people understand on first look. We design the flows that matter most, like
              booking, joining or buying, and test them before anything is built.
            </p>
            <ul class="f-leaflist">
              <li>User flows and wireframes</li>
              <li>High-fidelity designs in Figma</li>
              <li>Clickable prototypes</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>
      </li>
      <li data-f-reveal style="--d:0.14s">
        <details class="f-service">
          <summary>
            <span class="f-service__name">Brand identity</span>
            <span class="f-service__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="f-service__body">
            <p>
              A logo, colours, type and voice that look like you on every screen, sign and post,
              written down so anyone on your team can use them.
            </p>
            <ul class="f-leaflist">
              <li>Logo and mark</li>
              <li>Colour and type system</li>
              <li>Brand guidelines</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>
      </li>
      <li data-f-reveal style="--d:0.21s">
        <details class="f-service">
          <summary>
            <span class="f-service__name">Search growth</span>
            <span class="f-service__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="f-service__body">
            <p>
              Technical SEO built in from the first line of code, then content and local search
              work that brings in people already looking for you.
            </p>
            <ul class="f-leaflist">
              <li>Technical SEO and site speed</li>
              <li>Google Business Profile setup</li>
              <li>Monthly search reports</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>
      </li>
      <li data-f-reveal style="--d:0.28s">
        <details class="f-service">
          <summary>
            <span class="f-service__name">Online stores</span>
            <span class="f-service__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="f-service__body">
            <p>
              Shops on Shopify, WooCommerce or a custom stack, designed around a checkout that
              doesn't lose people halfway.
            </p>
            <ul class="f-leaflist">
              <li>Product pages that sell</li>
              <li>Payments and shipping setup</li>
              <li>Inventory and order tools</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>
      </li>
      <li data-f-reveal style="--d:0.35s">
        <details class="f-service">
          <summary>
            <span class="f-service__name">Marketing</span>
            <span class="f-service__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="f-service__body">
            <p>
              Social, ads and email that sound like your brand and point back to a site built to
              convert the attention they bring.
            </p>
            <ul class="f-leaflist">
              <li>Instagram content and ads</li>
              <li>Email campaigns</li>
              <li>Results you can read</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
